  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "客观评价老对手谢灵  (An Objective Verdict on Rival Xie Ling)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In a flashback to her private consultation with Chun Yuqiao, Xingtian's chairwoman asks whether rival producer Xie Ling can be trusted after volunteering to leave ME following Supernova's defeat. Listen to Chun Yuqiao in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "他可以算得上是业内一流的高手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "咱们客观地说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "在我离开星天之后，你需要一个合适的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "他确实是你在市场上能够找到的最合适的接任者。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "以他的专业能力和手里的资源来看，实力很强。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "让星天和合作卫视保持现在的领先位置，应该没有问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "工作上的评估，当然要就事论事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "过去的竞争，不影响我对他能力的判断。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "超新星虽然输给了十二歌王，但他的制作功底还在。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "引进人才确实能解决公司目前的困境。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "至于他的为人，你以后在共事中自然会看清楚。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "希望星天接下来一切顺利。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "他可以算得上是业内一流的高手。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He certainly ranks among the top-tier players in the industry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "咱们客观地说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let us look at this objectively.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "在我离开星天之后，你需要一个合适的人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now that I have left Xingtian, you need a suitable person to step in.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "他确实是你在市场上能够找到的最合适的接任者。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He really is the most suitable successor you can find on the market.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "以他的专业能力和手里的资源来看，实力很强。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Judging by his professional ability and resources, he is very strong.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "让星天和合作卫视保持现在的领先位置，应该没有问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Keeping Xingtian and its partner network in their current leading spot should be no problem.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "工作上的评估，当然要就事论事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When evaluating work, one should judge purely on the merits.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "过去的竞争，不影响我对他能力的判断。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Past competition does not cloud my judgment of his capabilities.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "超新星虽然输给了十二歌王，但他的制作功底还在。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Although Supernova lost to Twelve Singers, his production skills remain solid.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "引进人才确实能解决公司目前的困境。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bringing in talent really can resolve the company's current predicament.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "至于他的为人，你以后在共事中自然会看清楚。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As for his character, you will naturally see it clearly once you work with him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "希望星天接下来一切顺利。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I hope everything goes smoothly for Xingtian from here on.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
